duct/166407/yugioh-flames-of-destruction-kai-den-kendo-spirit", "modifiedOn": "2018-06-14T19:27:32.143", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Number", "displayName": "Number", "value": "FLOD-EN000"}, {"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Common"}, {"name": "Attribute", "displayName": "Attribute", "value": "WIND"}, {"name": "Card Type", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Pendulum/Spirit/Effect Monster"}, {"name": "Attack", "displayName": "Attack", "value": "2400"}, {"name": "Defense", "displayName": "Defense", "value": "1000"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pendulum Effect:</strong> If a monster(s) is Pendulum Summoned: Return this card in your Pendulum Zone to your hand.\r\n<br><strong>Monster Effect:</strong> When this card is Normal Summoned: you can choose one card in your Pendulum Zone, and send to the Graveyard all cards your opponent controls in that column. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Normal Summoned or flipped face-up this turn: Return this card to the hand."}]}, {"productId": 166408, "name": "Monster Reborn Reborn (FLOD-ENSP1)", "cleanName": "Monster Reborn Reborn FLOD ENSP1", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/166408_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 2, "groupId": 2212, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/166408/yugioh-flames-of-destruction-monster-reborn-reborn-flod-ensp1", "modifiedOn": "2026-02-03T17:49:19.923", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Number", "displayName": "Number", "value": "FLOD-ENSP1"}, {"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Ultra Rare"}, {"name": "Attribute", "displayName": "Attribute", "value": "SPELL"}, {"name": "Card Type", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Normal Spell"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "Target 3 monsters in your GY; your opponent chooses 1, you Special Summon it, and if you do, banish the rest. You can only activate 1 \"Monster Reborn Reborn\" per turn."}]}, {"productId": 166529, "name": "Crystal Keeper", "cleanName": "Crystal Keeper", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/166529_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 2, "groupId": 2212, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/166529/yugioh-flames-of-destruction-crystal-keeper", "modifiedOn": "2018-06-14T20:25:17.26", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Number", "displayName": "Number", "value": "FLOD-EN093"}, {"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Common"}, {"name": "Attribute", "displayName": "Attribute", "value": "FIRE"}, {"name": "MonsterType", "displayName": "Monster Type", "value": "Warrior"}, {"name": "Card Type", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Pendulum/Effect Monster"}, {"name": "Attack", "displayName": "Attack", "value": "1500"}, {"name": "Defense", "displayName": "Defense", "value": "1800"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pendulum Effect:</strong> Each turn, the first time an \"Ultimate Crystal\" monster(s) and/or \"Crystal Beast\" card(s) you control would be destroyed by card effect that turn, it is not destroyed.\r\n<br><strong>Monster Effect:</strong> If a \"Crystal Beast\" monster you control battles an opponent's monster, during damage calculation (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card from your hand or face-up from your field: your battling monster's ATK/DEF become double its original ATK/DEF during that damage calculation only, but it is destroyed at the end of this Damage Step."}]}, {"productId": 168261, "name": "Flames of Destruction - Special Edition", "cleanName": "Flames of Destruction Special Edition", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/168261_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 2, "groupId": 2212, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/168261/yugioh-flames-of-destruction-flames-of-destruction-special-edition", "modifiedOn": "2018-06-07T13:36:12.223", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "Didn\u2019t get enough of <strong>Flames of Destruction</strong>? Well each box of <strong>Flames of Destruction Special Edition</strong> includes 3 booster packs of Flames of Destruction, along with 1 of 2 Super Rare variants of sought-after cards as well as 1 of 2 Super Rare variant preview cards from the upcoming Summer 2018 booster set!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>Flames of Destruction</strong> shakes things up with new cards for established Deck themes, a brand-new Link Monster theme that can be played as its own Deck or spliced into existing strategies, the return of the Elemental Lords, and more!\r\n<br><br>\r\nThese new Link Monsters have flexible Link Materials that let you use them in any Deck, and each one has two abilities: one that you use when you Link Summon the monster and one that\u2019s always active. These powers range from retrieving any Spell or Trap Card from your Graveyard to changing the number of cards you get to draw each turn. With some strategic card placement, you could be drawing up to 6 cards at the start of your turn instead of just 1!\r\n<br><br>\r\nTo make the most of these abilities, you\u2019ll want to keep your Link Monsters co-linked. If you do, you\u2019ll get a refund on the cost of the new monsters\u2019 one-shot abilities and their always-on powers will grow much stronger! Try combining these monsters with cards like Tri-Gate Wizard from Structure Deck: Cyberse Link or Firewall Dragon from Code of the Duelist to gain even more from co-linking your monsters.\r\n<br><br>\r\nOn top of all that, <strong>Flames of Destruction</strong> is full of cards that are useful in any Deck and cards that elevate popular themes to new heights! You could find... \r\n<br>\u2022 Powerful Trap Cards you can activate from your hand. \r\n<br>\u2022 A new Trap Hole that banishes monsters face down. \r\n<br>\u2022 A Spell that revives one of your monsters in a Zone a Link Monster is pointing to. \r\n<br>\u2022 A new Topologic Link Monster that banishes all Spells and Traps on the field when a monster is Special Summoned to a Zone it points to. \r\n<br>\u2022 A Dragon that can erase all the cards in a single column and then render that column unusable. \r\n<br>\u2022 A Trickstar soloist that shrugs off activated card effects and inflicts big damage every turn.\r\n<br><br>\r\nEach <strong>Flames of Destruction Special Edition box</strong> contains: 3 Flames of Destruction booster packs, 1 of 2 Super Rare variants of sought-after cards, and 1 of 2 Super Rare preview cards from the Summer 2018 booster set."}, {"name": "UPC", "displayName": "UPC", "value": "083717837527"}]}, {"productId": 168265, "name": "Grandsoil the Elemental Lord", "cleanName": "Grandsoil the Elemental Lord", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/168265_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 2, "groupId": 2212, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/168265/yugioh-flames-of-destruction-grandsoil-the-elemental-lord", "modifiedOn": "2024-07-26T18:49:54.523", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Number", "displayName": "Number", "value": "FLOD-ENSE1"}, {"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Super Rare"}, {"name": "Attribute", "displayName": "Attribute", "value": "EARTH"}, {"name": "MonsterType", "displayName": "Monster Type", "value": "Beast-Warrior"}, {"name": "Card Type", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Effect Monster"}, {"name": "Attack", "displayName": "Attack", "value": "2800"}, {"name": "Defense", "displayName": "Defense", "value": "2200"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summo